BRA.revenue.2025","ZBRA.sbc.2020","ZBRA.revenue.2020"]},{"topic":"returns","text":"In FY2025 the company paid $587 million to repurchase its own shares. No dividend payment is tagged for the year.","cites":["ZBRA.buybacks.2025"]},{"topic":"quarter","text":"In the three months ended 2026-10-03 revenue was $1.6 billion, up 22.3% from $1.3 billion in the three months ended 2025-09-27.","cites":["ZBRA.d.revenue.2026-07-05.2026-10-03","ZBRA.d.revenue.2025-06-29.2025-09-27"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-10-03 revenue added up to $6.1 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $912 million and net income to $602 million.","cites":["ZBRA.d.revenue.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","ZBRA.d.revenue.2025-01-01.2025-09-27","ZBRA.d.revenue.2026-01-01.2026-04-04","ZBRA.d.revenue.2026-04-05.2026-07-04","ZBRA.d.revenue.2026-07-05.2026-10-03","ZBRA.d.opinc.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","ZBRA.d.opinc.2025-01-01.2025-09-27","ZBRA.d.opinc.2026-01-01.2026-04-04","ZBRA.d.opinc.2026-04-05.2026-07-04","ZBRA.d.opinc.2026-07-05.2026-10-03","ZBRA.d.netinc.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","ZBRA.d.netinc.2025-01-01.2025-09-27","ZBRA.d.netinc.2026-01-01.2026-04-04","ZBRA.d.netinc.2026-04-05.2026-07-04","ZBRA.d.netinc.2026-07-05.2026-10-03"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $988 million: operating cash flow of $1.1 billion less capital spending of $80 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["ZBRA.d.ocf.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","ZBRA.d.ocf.2025-01-01.2025-09-27","ZBRA.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-04-04","ZBRA.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-07-04","ZBRA.d.ocf.2026-01-01.2026-10-03","ZBRA.d.capex.2025-01-01.2025-12-31","ZBRA.d.capex.2025-01-01.2025-09-27","ZBRA.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-04-04","ZBRA.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-07-04","ZBRA.d.capex.2026-01-01.2026-10-03"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $842 million at the end of FY2025 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $757 million a year earlier.","cites":["ZBRA.deferred.2025","ZBRA.deferred.2024"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 10,700 in its own words. FY2025 revenue works out to about $504,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["ZBRA.q.employees","ZBRA.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2025 annual report tags restructuring charges of $76 million, after $17 million in FY2024.","cites":["ZBRA.restructuring.2025","ZBRA.restructuring.2024"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2025 the balance sheet carried $125 million in cash and cash equivalents, and $2.5 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + LongTermDebtCurrent). Debt less cash was $2.4 billion (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["ZBRA.cash.2025","ZBRA.debtLong.2025","ZBRA.debtCurrent.2025"]}]},"fin":{"ZBRA":{}},"quotes":{"ZBRA.q.employees":{"c":"ZBRA","kind":"employees","n":10700,"quote":"As of December 31, 2025, the Company had approximately 10,700 employees globally, with a majority in sales and technical roles.","source":"ZBRA-0001628280-26-007668","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-02-12","proof":"afac15311a88ec056dffda5d6092c63bd9d0e3aeee5696c1577a230d2fe4d127"}}}